{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PCL3eAbXxfFfPAWMX3kQ8r","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 gen-depth-contamination 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (69 个)\\n\\n- **exp_016_base_vs_instruct**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_003_decoding_ablation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_004_7b_crossscale**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_E_paired_stats**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_D_obd_n500**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_B_14d_ablation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_A_alt_scorer**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_015_neural_probe**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_006_graduated_filtering**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_007_bootstrap_ci**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_011_llm_zeroshot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_013_cross_transfer**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_010_ordinal_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_pythia_depth**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_sat_v1**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-18\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_32b_c4 | Scale-dependent K* on C4: Qwen2.5-32B fp16 continuation on C4 web text 的 K* 是否仍 = 2？验证 K*=2 dominant mode 在 32B scale 是否稳定（已确认 1.5B/7B/8B/14B 均 K*=2），排除 scale ceiling effect。5000 docs, depth 0-5, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_008_retrain_chain: Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) retrain-chain K* ≤ prompt-chain K*=2. 每代独立 LoRA fine-tune 1 epoch on 前代输出，再用 fine-tuned model 生成下一代。验证 prompt-chain 是 conservative upper bound。C4 5K docs, depth 0-4, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_026_arxiv_filtering** (negative): Graduated depth weighting (α=0.9^d) on arXiv depth chains will outperform both no-filter and binary-cut baselines on downstream benchmarks (MMLU, HellaSwag), because it preserves useful signal from deeper generations while down-weighting accumulated contamination, rather than discarding data entirely. ← 基于 exp_006_graduated_filtering\\n- **exp_027_latex_ablation** (success): arXiv K*=3 不依赖 LaTeX 格式特征。去除 LaTeX markup 后重新提取 15D features 并跑 pairwise classification，K* 应仍=3，排除 LaTeX 语法作为 confound。 ← 基于 exp_024_arxiv_depth_chain\\n  [exp027_latex_ablation_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/exp_027_latex_ablation/report/exp027_comparison.md)\\n- **exp_025_pythia_filtering** (negative): Filtering strategy ordering (binary > graduated > no-filter) 在 Pythia-1.4B 上与 Qwen 一致，验证 K*=2 对 curation 策略选择的跨模型预测价值。Pythia-1.4B LoRA rank=8 continued pretraining on C4 depth chain, 3 strategies × 3 seeds, eval MMLU+HellaSwag. ← 基于 exp_006_graduated_filtering\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 49 / 负向 9 / 失败 9 / 共 67\\nk_star: 3 →（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-22115: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\nwestd-42896: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp-008-retrain-chain: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_10pct: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_30pct: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_50pct: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_10pct_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_30pct_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_009_dose_50pct_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_wiki_pythia: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_wiki_olmo: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WwG7Aq1RUmx67aCcPtNmEQ","session_id":"d37fb44e-7e5b-48a2-b4c1-fa5a7ae0cff1","uuid":"a5eb7c07-b63f-4264-a059-b7d46fec95fb","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:09:36.508Z"}
